rafting #craftwithme #engravedclipboard", "timestamp": "2026-08-06T00:50:05.000Z", "videoDuration": 20.037369, "videoPlayCount": 2940, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 18, "commentsCount": 18, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-mxp1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/763722145_18423498790178865_2516485342071476469_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=106&ig_cache_key=Mzk1NzM4ODEzMDYyNTQwOTE0OTE4NDIzNDk4Nzg0MTc4ODY1.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=h_2_XI1ZkSYQ7kNvwFpcdRG&_nc_oc=AdpCt5-x-_COVzCprMPZjpxLj9STFVocf1fjLR7SE5L92pNwBxBN0EN2WXD3dQfZx5U&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=jucfb-cQFurNy8vZfZ86pg&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJNppkKMKjeMZNuuXtxaMXLPAiKntCIQLlRYgy5X9iaKw&oe=6A9A2BDC", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-mxp1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQMQi46-3mZ_5CxyNSVvwaHBp7mRLKZBBCRdcvVzJWO0z8MxnZKJLXTVMQGw_Mc82MgB3JY217SC-GUVjO9OY7-Z9eJDuqvSbYkLMP8.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=JMYd9-xy5l0Q7kNvwGFdyf5&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MjkxMzc4NDU3NTY2OTEyOSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjI0LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDA5OSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MjAsInVybGdlbl9zb3VyY2UiOiJ3d3cifQ%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=7a9fd76e2ae9370d&_nc_&_nc_gid=jucfb-cQFurNy8vZfZ86pg&_nc_zt=28&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJAmfe9rM-q7FAFdFkPfTF96PxaDKn9pSqnanktemkUjw&oe=6A962F94", "ownerUsername": "slayathomemother", "ownerFullName": "Corinne Burghardt \ud83c\udfe1 \u2728 Slay At Home Mother", "history": [{"date": "2026-08-09", "plays": 1929, "likes": 11, "comments": 14}, {"date": "2026-08-16", "plays": 2766, "likes": 15, "comments": 18}, {"date": "2026-08-23", "plays": 2907, "likes": 18, "comments": 18}, {"date": "2026-08-30", "plays": 2940, "likes": 18, "comments": 18}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Can you meet me halfway? Right at the